{
  "summary": "This experiment tested combining the scvi_n200 RNA encoder with a stronger image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) and weighted fusion in a multimodal, multiprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7062 (vs. RNA-only baseline 0.6501). The result suggests that improved image encoders and fusion strategies may enhance performance, but the relative contribution of each component remains uncertain due to lack of isolated comparisons. Further experiments are needed to validate these findings and explore alternative fusion methods or encoders."
}

